":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"לא לצבוע את החולצה שלה!","en":"Don't dye her shirt!","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הוא צובע את הבגדים שלו.","en":"He is dying his clothes.","alt":[],"t":"l","inferred":1},{"he":"אנחנו רואות ארנבת שחורה.","en":"We see a black rabbit.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הוא לובש מכנסיים סגולים.","en":"He is wearing purple pants.","alt":[],"t":"t","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/8576ee8b34ce8ef6033790347514d3dc"},{"he":"הינשוף הירוק אוהב ללמוד.","en":"The green owl likes to learn.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"המכנסיים של הילד אדומים.","en":"The pants of the boy are red.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הצבע של הינשוף הוא ירוק.","en":"The color of the owl is green.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"היא לובשת ג'ינסים כחולים.","en":"She wears blue jeans.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אנחנו רוצים תפוזים כתומים.","en":"We want orange oranges.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"ורוד זה צבע של נשים וגברים.","en":"Pink is a women's and men's color.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני לא אוהבת את השמלה החומה.","en":"I don't like the brown dress.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"פלפלים הם אדומים, כתומים, צהובים או ירוקים.","en":"Peppers are red, orange, yellow or green.","alt":[],"t":"l"}],"hints":{"חום":"brown / brown (m.s) / heat, warmth","לבן":"white / white (m.s)","אדום":"red / red (m.s)","ירוק":"green / green (m.s)","כחול":"blue / blue (m.s)","כתום":"orange / orange (Colour) (m.s)","סגול":"purple / purple (m.s)","צהוב":"yellow (sg. masc.) / yellow / yellow (m.s)","שחור":"black / black (m.s)","ורוד":"pink / pink (m.s)","צעיף":"a scarf / scarf / scarf, shawl","צבעוני":"colorful / colourful (m.s)","זה":"it / it is / it's","גזר":"a carrot / carrot","צבע":"colour","או":"or","שלי":"mine / my","אני":"I / I am / I am a girl","צובעת":"color / is painting / paint","ביצה":"an egg / egg","הכובע":"the hat / the hat is","הספרים":"the books / the books are","הולך":"walk, go (m.s - pres.) / walk, go / m.s.","הגבר":"the man / the man is","לובש":"is wearing / wear / wears","הם":"are / they / they are","שותים":"are drinking / drink / drinking","חלב":"milk","התפוח":"the apple / the apple is","חמוץ":"sour / sour (m.s)","יש":"I have / do you have / has","לי":"I have / for me / me","שמלה":"a dress / dress, gown, robe","רוצָה":"want / wants / would like","היא":"her / it / she","קונָה":"buy / buys / is buying","כובע":"hat, cap","רואָה":"is seeing / see / sees","מים":"water","הוא":"(he) is / (it) is / he","מעיל":"a coat / coat, cloak","שלו":"his / its","לא":"aren't / didn't / do not","אוהבת":"like / likes / love","אין":"not has / not have / nothing can be done","מכנסיים":"pants / trousers / pants, trousers","אוכל":"eat / eating / eats","עוגה":"a cake / cake","החתול":"the cat","שותֶה":"drink / drinking / drinks","אוהב":"like / likes / love","את":"it / that / the fruit","הצבע":"the color","אפרסק":"a peach / peach","לצבוע":"to paint, colour, tint","החולצה":"the shirt","שלה":"her / her boys / her children","צובע":"paint (m.s - pres.)","אנחנו":"we / we are / we (c.p)","רואות":"see / see (f.p - pres.)","ארנבת":"hare","סגולים":"purple (pl. masc.)","ללמוד":"studying (gerund) / to learn / to study","של":"'s / Abraham's / avraham's","הילד":"the boy / the boy is / the kid","לובשת":"is wearing / wear / wears","רוצים":"do you want / want / want (m.p - pres.)","תפוזים":"oranges / orange (Fruit)","נשים":"woman / wife / women","פלפלים":"pepper, capsicum"},"words":[{"he":"רוצָה","en":"want","alt":["wants"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"rotzeh"},{"he":"הכובע","en":"the hat","alt":["the hat is"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"לובש","en":"is wearing","alt":["wear","wears"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"lovesh"},{"he":"צהוב","en":"yellow (sg. masc.)","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"tzahov"},{"he":"צעיף","en":"scarf","alt":["a scarf"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"tza'if"},{"he":"ירוק","en":"green","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"yarok"},{"he":"סגולים","en":"purple (pl. masc.)","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"צובעת","en":"color","alt":["is painting","paint"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"tzova'at"},{"he":"ביצה","en":"an egg","alt":["egg"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"beitzah"},{"he":"לצבוע","en":"To Paint, Colour, Tint (Qal)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"litz'boa"},{"he":"כחול","en":"Blue (m.s)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"kakhol"},{"he":"ורוד","en":"Pink (m.s)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"varod"},{"he":"צבעוני","en":"Colourful (m.s)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"tziv'oni"},{"he":"צובע","en":"Paint (m.s - pres.)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"tzovea"},{"he":"כתום","en":"Orange (Colour) (m.s)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"katom"},{"he":"שלי","en":"my","alt":["mine"],"from":"phrase","tr":"sheli"},{"he":"אני","en":"I am","alt":["I","me"],"from":"phrase","tr":"ani"},{"he":"הוא","en":"he","alt":["(he) is","(it) is"],"from":"phrase","tr":"hu"},{"he":"מכנסיים","en":"pants","alt":["trousers"],"from":"phrase","tr":"mikh'nasayim"}],"lexemes":["לצבוע","הירוק","צהוב","כחול","ורוד","צבעוני","ירוק","כחולים","צובעת","צבעונית","האפור","צובע","צהובים","אפורה","כתום","ורודים","ירוקים","צבעונים","כתומים"],"tips":"Many colors in Hebrew fit the following pattern, in which the masculine singular includes the vowel \"o\", while the other conjugations include the vowel \"u\".\n\no -> u pattern:\n---\nUsing סגול (purple) as an example:\n\n|masculine singular|feminine singular|masculine/mixed plural|feminine plural|\n|:-----|------|------:|  \n|סגול|סגולה|סגולים|סגולות|\n|sagól|sgulá|sgulím|sgulót|\n\n---------\nThe colors black (שחור shakhór) and gray (אפור afór) follow a slightly different pattern, in which the \"o\" sound **doesn't** change to an \"u\" sound in the plural and  feminine singular conjugations:\n\no -> o pattern:\n---\nUsing שחור as an example:  \n\n|masculine singular|feminine singular|masculine/mixed plural|feminine plural|\n|:-----|-----|------:|  \n|שחור|שחורה|שחורים|שחורות|\n|shakhór|shkhorá|shkhorím|shkhorót|"}